# The 3.4 GB torch wheel and the 30 GB of weights never enter the repository, so plain
# git works; this only keeps line endings stable across the platforms the two installers
# target. Repository content is normalised to LF, and the checked-out form follows the
# platform that consumes it: bash needs LF, PowerShell does not care.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
